Those paths are where the files sit inside an installed package and
inside smtv.pyz; this repository keeps them under `src/`.

The example package embeds three PDF documents whose own metadata names
Frank Scherenschlich as their author, and a STEP model produced with
FreeCAD/OpenCASCADE. They travel unmodified.

Copyright for that material: Industrial Digital Twin Association (IDTA)
and the template's contributors. THIRD_PARTY.md travels beside this file
and names the upstream revision they were taken from; the SHA-256 digest
of each one is recorded in a `sha256sums.txt` in its own directory.
